# Flags for the jiggle helper (~/.config/omacos/jiggle.swift), one per line, # = comment.
#
# --activate  activate the app for ~0.5 s, nudge, then give the focus straight back.
#             Citrix Viewer only forwards input it receives while it is the active app,
#             so without this the remote session goes Away anyway (tested 2026-09-22).
# --key       also press F15 — invisible in Windows, still counts as input there.
# --global    a real event at the window centre, cursor warped back (for apps that watch
#             the event stream with a tap instead of through their own window).
# --click     add a left click in the middle of the window (can hit whatever is there).
# --dx 8      how far the pointer is nudged before it moves back (default 4 px).
--activate
--key
